menu "Face database"

    config FACEDB_MAX_RECORDS
        int "Templates the table holds in PSRAM"
        default 1000
        range 2 4000
        help
            One record is 552 bytes (KEHOACH 6.2.4), so the default of 500
            people with two templates each reserves 552 KB of PSRAM once at
            init. A table that fills up compacts its soft-deleted records
            first and refuses the enrol only when that frees nothing.

endmenu
